  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "The top of a soda can is visibly narrower",
      "start": 0.071,
      "end": 2.089
    },
    {
      "text": "than the rest of it,",
      "start": 2.143,
      "end": 2.839
    },
    {
      "text": "tapering inward just before the lid.",
      "start": 3.066,
      "end": 4.673
    },
    {
      "text": "That taper is not shaped for your mouth.",
      "start": 4.973,
      "end": 6.509
    },
    {
      "text": "The lid has to be much thicker than the",
      "start": 6.786,
      "end": 8.197
    },
    {
      "text": "walls,",
      "start": 8.269,
      "end": 8.693
    },
    {
      "text": "because it holds the pressure and carries a",
      "start": 8.805,
      "end": 10.429
    },
    {
      "text": "tab you can tear open with one finger.",
      "start": 10.501,
      "end": 12.215
    },
    {
      "text": "Thick metal is expensive metal,",
      "start": 12.534,
      "end": 13.963
    },
    {
      "text": "so shrinking the lid saves far more aluminum",
      "start": 14.247,
      "end": 16.177
    },
    {
      "text": "than shaving the sides ever could.",
      "start": 16.211,
      "end": 17.533
    },
    {
      "text": "Six millimeters have come off it since the",
      "start": 17.921,
      "end": 19.634
    },
    {
      "text": "sixties,",
      "start": 19.707,
      "end": 20.169
    },
    {
      "text": "saving close to two hundred million pounds",
      "start": 20.342,
      "end": 22.003
    },
    {
      "text": "a year.",
      "start": 22.056,
      "end": 22.592
    }
  ],
